{"4797040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One vs All", "steam_appid": 4797040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One vs All is an asymmetric VR local party game. One person in VR is playing against all other people who join through their phones. The non-VR players are all sharing a single screen. Best enjoyed when playing together in a single room, so people can take turns playing in VR!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Mini Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select through various mini games in a cozy environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/7fcd62430356ca93c132be6cc1339bf4.poster.avif?t=1782851073\" width=960 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/7fcd62430356ca93c132be6cc1339bf4.webm?t=1782851073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/7fcd62430356ca93c132be6cc1339bf4.mp4?t=1782851073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Castle Defense Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defends the castle using a bow and arrows from a horde of skeletons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/4cb256b1b20a0366ee9a0f8d395d5024.poster.avif?t=1782851073\" width=960 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/4cb256b1b20a0366ee9a0f8d395d5024.webm?t=1782851073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797040/extras/4cb256b1b2